note bottom
  **Key Deliverables:**

  **Week 2:** Database schema, service layer, frontend structure
  **Week 4:** Full cycle CRUD, execution control, UI components
  **Week 6:** Constellation management, visual designer
  **Week 8:** Real-time monitoring, Socket.IO integration
  **Week 10:** Analytics, performance optimization, documentation
  **Week 12:** Production deployment, monitoring

  **Critical Path:** Backend services → Frontend components → Integration
  **Buffer:** 1 week built into each phase for unexpected issues
end note

